{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225470","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322547001:1":{"text":"바레샤 성 근처에서 또다시 이교도들을 발견했다는 보고입니다. 이번에는 무슨 음모를 꾸미고 있는지 모르겠군요.","source_cn":"我们的人在瓦勒沙城堡附近又发现了一些邪教徒，不知道他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5A30E7A2A232708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322547002:1":{"text":"이자들은 근위병보다는 마법을 아는 사람을 더욱 경계하는 것 같습니다.","source_cn":"这些人似乎并不害怕侍卫，反而更加畏惧懂得神秘魔法力量的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60E8E644DED32A42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322547003:1":{"text":"마법사님, 이번에도 부탁드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"魔法师大人，这次又得麻烦您了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6740D0DD4C47B6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"근위대장 로드리고","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}